OL,3,AUganda imposes 21-day quarantine on
OL,4,Acitizens returning from DR Congo
OL,5,
OL,6,FUgandans returning from neighbouring
OL,7,FDemocratic Republic of Congo will be
OL,8,Fquarantined for 21 days, the health
OL,9,Fministry has said, as the country
OL,10,Ftightens restrictions to contain the
OL,11,Fspread of Ebola virus.
OL,13,FMore than 4,800 people have died in DR
OL,14,FCongo since May - the country's
OL,15,Fdeadliest outbreak of the disease - and
OL,16,Fhas since spread to several other
OL,17,Fcountries.
OL,19,FUganda's restrictions follow questions
OL,20,Fafter two people who had travelled
OL,21,Fthrough the country tested positive for
OL,22,FEbola, in Kenya and Nigeria.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
