OL,3,AUganda imposes 21-day quarantine on
OL,4,Acitizens returning from DR Congo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health ministry on Sunday said the
OL,7,F60 people who were being monitored
OL,8,Fafter coming into contact with the
OL,9,FKenyan Ebola patient had all been
OL,10,Fdischarged.
